<http://data.silknow.org/event/9bfeda1f-ddf5-3a49-886d-adb77535005b>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Probably made for and owned by Cardinal Wolsey or Henry VIII.\nBought from E Lowengard, Paris. At the time it entered the Museum, it was thought to date to 1507-1510, but in 2007 Thomas Campbell suggested about 1520. See Object production note."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
